OL,3,GNEWSAMP says Polanski must 'work
OL,4,Aurgently' on Zionism crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former leader of the Green Party has
OL,7,Fcalled on the present leader Zack
OL,8,FPolanski to work with him and other
OL,9,Fsenior MPs to "urgently address the
OL,10,Fsituation" following the party's
OL,11,Fcontroversial vote on Zionism.
OL,13,FAdrian Ramsay, MP for Waveney Valley in
OL,14,FNorfolk and Suffolk, told the BBC
OL,15,FPolitics East programme that Polanski
OL,16,F"did not show the leadership I would
OL,17,Fhave liked to have seen".
OL,19,FHe refused to say if he should stay on
OL,20,Fas leader, but acknowledged "a lot
OL,21,Fdepends on what happens in the days and
OL,22,Fweeks to come".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
