OL,3,GNEWSAMP says Polanski must 'work
OL,4,Aurgently' on Zionism crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Greens' conference passed a motion
OL,7,Fthis week declaring that Zionism was
OL,8,Fracist and called for "single
OL,9,Fdemocratic Palestinian state in all of
OL,10,Fhistoric Palestine".
